BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 760 Td
(Nordvik DW-450 Dishwasher - User Manual) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Safety) Tj T*
(Read this manual before using the appliance. Keep children away from the appliance while) Tj T*
(it is running. Disconnect the power before cleaning or maintenance. Do not use the) Tj T*
(appliance if the power cable is damaged; it must be replaced by Nordvik service.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Installation) Tj T*
(Connect the inlet hose to a cold water tap. Make sure the drain hose is not kinked and) Tj T*
(that its highest point is between 40 and 90 cm above the floor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Everyday use) Tj T*
(Load plates facing the centre and glasses in the upper basket. Use the Eco programme for) Tj T*
(normally soiled dishes; it takes 3 hours 50 minutes but uses the least water and energy.) Tj T*
(The Quick 30 programme is for lightly soiled dishes only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Care and maintenance) Tj T*
(Clean the filter at the bottom of the tub once a week. Refill rinse aid when the) Tj T*
(indicator lights up. In hard water areas, set the water softener to level 5 and use) Tj T*
(dishwasher salt.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
