stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 760 Td
(Warranty) Tj T*
(The warranty period is 24 months from the date of purchase and covers manufacturing) Tj T*
(defects. The warranty does not cover damage from limescale; descale every three months) Tj T*
(in hard water areas. The warranty is valid in the country of purchase. Keep your receipt) Tj T*
(as proof of the purchase date. Register your appliance at nordvik-home.example/register) Tj T*
(within 60 days to get an extra year of parts cover.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Error codes) Tj T*
(E1 - water inlet problem: check that the tap is open and the hose is not kinked. E4 -) Tj T*
(leak detected: turn off the water supply and contact service. E9 - the door is not) Tj T*
(closed properly.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Service) Tj T*
(Nordvik customer service: +46 8 555 019 40, weekdays 08:00-17:00. Have the model and) Tj T*
(serial number ready; they are on the label inside the door.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
